Clean Android Share, Open with, browser/deep links, long-press shortcuts and file-picker candidates with priority ordering, Apply confirmation and multi-space support. Bottom navigation is Controls / Cleanup / Settings with Entry / Component editors in Cleanup. Controls provides Module status, default/per-category cleanup methods, enabled/disabled switches and mixed Entry/Component favorites. Root manages launcher icons, tiles, shortcut-creation activities, widgets, device controls and authenticators. Requires Android 12+, modern libxposed API 102 and Root permission for component operations.
